%% TRIP-006 Reviews
flowchart TD
    subgraph Admin
        Form[Form Nytt omdöme<br/>R3] --> Save[Spara omdöme]
        Save --> Valid{All fields filled in?<br/>R4}
        Valid -- no --> Err[Message for the missing field]
        Err --> Form
        Valid -- yes --> Saved[Omdömet sparades.<br/>R5]
        List[List: person, stars, trash can<br/>R6] --> Sure{Är du säker?}
        Sure -- Ja --> Deleted[Review deleted]
        Sure -- Nej --> List
    end
    Saved --> DB[(reviews)]
    Deleted --> DB
    DB --> Carousel[Start page carousel,<br/>newest in focus<br/>R1]
    Carousel --> Browse[Arrows, arrow keys, click or swipe<br/>R2]
    Browse --> Carousel
